WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.542
Ricky: Excuse me, ma'am.

2
00:00:08.543 --> 00:00:11.008
Driver: What's the problem?

3
00:00:11.009 --> 00:00:15.097
Ricky: My friend and I are on the wrong bus.

4
00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:19.894
Brian: Yeah, we need Newman, not New Mont.

5
00:00:19.895 --> 00:00:28.946
Driver: No problem.

6
00:00:28.947 --> 00:00:39.025
Ricky: I'm sorry, Brian. It's my fault.

7
00:00:39.026 --> 00:00:41.606
Driver: This one is going to Newman.

8
00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:48.082
Ricky: Thank you so much.

9
00:00:48.083 --> 00:00:51.863
Ricky: I should have looked more carefully.

10
00:00:51.864 --> 00:01:03.552
Brian: We're on the right bus now.

11
00:01:03.553 --> 00:01:08.065
Driver: This is the final destination, boys.

12
00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:13.613
Ricky: Are we in the right place?

13
00:01:13.614 --> 00:01:16.775
Brian: Yeah, look! There's Brenda!

14
00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:22.609
Ricky: We finally made it!

15
00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:25.816
Brenda: Welcome to Newman, guys!

16
00:01:25.817 --> 00:01:30.575
Ricky: Not New Mont!

